"start","alignItems":"start","children":[{"type":"frame","id":"f136","name":"页头","width":"fill_container","height":"fit_content","layout":"vertical","gap":18,"alignItems":"start","children":[{"type":"text","content":"导数的符号，决定曲线的走向","id":"t135","name":"页标题","width":"fill_container","fill":"$c-ink","fontFamily":"Noto Sans SC","fontSize":76,"lineHeight":1.12,"letterSpacing":-1.52,"textGrowth":"fixed-width","fontWeight":"700"}]},{"type":"frame","id":"f138","name":"图文区","width":"fill_container","height":"fill_container","layout":"vertical","gap":0,"justifyContent":"center","alignItems":"start","children":[{"type":"frame","id":"f137","name":"图文两栏","width":"fill_container","height":560,"layout":"horizontal","gap":48,"children":[{"type":"frame","id":"f104","name":"知识点卡","width":"fill_container","height":"fill_container","cornerRadius":20,"fill":"$c-surface","layout":"horizontal","gap":0,"padding":[0,0],"clip":true,"children":[{"type":"rectangle","id":"r103","name":"知识点色条","width":10,"height":"fill_container","fill":"$c-accent"},{"type":"frame","id":"f102","name":"卡内容","width":"fill_container","height":"fill_container","layout":"vertical","gap":40,"padding":[44,44],"alignItems":"start","children":[{"type":"frame","id":"f97","name":"定义组","width":"fill_container","height":"fit_content","layout":"vertical","gap":20,"alignItems":"start","children":[{"type":"text","content":"单调性的判定定理","id":"t95","name":"定义标题","width":"fill_container","fill":"$c-ink","fontFamily":"Noto Sans SC","fontSize":40,"lineHeight":1.25,"letterSpacing":0,"textGrowth":"fixed-width","fontWeight":"600"},{"type":"text","content":"设函数 f(x) 在区间 (a, b) 内可导。若在该区间内恒有 f'(x) > 0，则 f(x) 在 (a, b) 上单调递增；若恒有 f'(x) < 0，则单调递减。","id":"t96","name":"定义正文","width":"fill_container","fill":"$c-ink","fontFamily":"Noto Sans SC","fontSize":30,"lineHeight":1.6,"letterSpacing":0,"textGrowth":"fixed-width","fontWeight":"400"}]},{"type":"frame","id":"f101","name":"追问组","width":"fill_container","height":"fit_content","layout":"vertical","